A known rejection must use the backend's approved failure semantics; it is not a confirmed order. A timeout or cancellation after submission does not prove the order failed. Never invent a retry or lookup endpoint to resolve that uncertainty.

## 3. Keep dependencies pointing toward contracts

Runtime calls can reach a network implementation without the domain importing that implementation.

<MermaidZoom title="Code dependencies — the domain does not import concrete adapters">

```mermaid
