    UI->>RULES: Place the selected chicken order
    RULES->>RULES: Validate the quantity
    Note over RULES: Continue only if input is valid
    RULES->>REPO: Submit the validated order
    REPO->>API: Send through the approved API contract
    API->>SERVER: Request order creation
    SERVER-->>API: Return the order response
