# Feature Flags — Control Chicken Ordering

A feature flag chooses between behaviors **already present in the installed app**. In My Chicken App, the example flag `chicken-ordering-enabled` decides whether a user may **start a new ordering journey**. It does not authorize an order or undo one already sent.

> **Confidential — internal use only.** Obtain endpoint and client-token configuration through the approved process. Never put backend/admin tokens, production data, or sensitive targeting information in mobile code, screenshots, or AI prompts.

## 1. Define the example behavior

