|---|---|
| Flag enabled and supported by the app | Allow the new ordering journey when the established access policy also permits it. |
| Flag disabled, missing, or not yet available | Keep the new ordering entry disabled. Preserve the rest of the app's supported behavior. |
| Flag changes while an order is submitting | Keep tracking the original order result. Do not silently reset state or resend. |
| Submission outcome is unknown | Continue reconciliation even if the flag is now disabled. |

These flag names and behaviors are teaching examples. Confirm the real feature requirements and approved flag names with the owner. A frontend token is distributed with the client; it is not a privileged backend credential.

